      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The American University of Greece has an academic and executive education presence in Boston, Massachusetts. The Boston campus focuses on study abroad pathways, executive education, research collaboration, and academic exchange programmes, connecting Greece, Europe, and the USA.</p>",
